  associate-with-catalyze: ?x1 - molecule ?x2 - molecule ?x3 - complex
      pre: (and (>= (available ?x1) (need-for-catalyzed-association ?x1 ?x2 ?x3)) (>= (available ?x2) (need-for-catalyzed-association ?x2 ?x1 ?x3)) (catalyzed-association-reaction ?x1 ?x2 ?x3))
